/**
 * Public, machine-readable view of hull-cleaning pricing.
 *
 * Feeds three surfaces that must agree with the /hull-cleaning estimator:
 *   - /pricing/hull-cleaning.json (generated by scripts/generate-pricing-json.mjs)
 *   - GET /api/hull-cleaning-quote (api/hull-cleaning-quote.js)
 *   - the "How pricing works" section and JSON-LD offers on /hull-cleaning
 *
 * Every number comes from diving-calculator.js. Nothing here sets a price.
 */
